# <type>(<optional scope>): <subject, imperative, no trailing period>
#
# Body: what changed and why (wrap at 72). Blank line above.
#
# Footer: BREAKING CHANGE: <desc>  |  Refs: #123
#
# type: feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# SemVer: fix -> PATCH, feat -> MINOR, `!` or BREAKING CHANGE -> MAJOR
